WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.461
[upbeat music]

00:00:09.259 --> 00:00:15.056
[cheers and bells ringing]

00:00:18.101 --> 00:00:21.062
[drumming]

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:26.401
[band plays fanfare]

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:30.071 align:start size:3% position:97% line:7%
♪

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:54.012
[cheering]

00:01:03.021 --> 00:01:07.484
To the students
of the Class of 2023

00:01:07.484 --> 00:01:10.779
and their parents
families and friends.

00:01:10.779 --> 00:01:14.574
Welcome to the 322nd

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:17.952
commencement of Yale University.

00:01:17.952 --> 00:01:21.706 line:76%
We salute your effort,
your diligence, your talent

00:01:21.706 --> 00:01:22.957 line:78%
and your intellect.

00:01:22.957 --> 00:01:25.752 line:76%
I now ask you
by your official act,

00:01:25.752 --> 00:01:29.047 line:76%
to confer upon them
these degrees.

00:01:29.047 --> 00:01:30.965
[cheers and applause]

00:01:30.965 --> 00:01:34.302
By the authority vested in me,
I confer upon you

00:01:34.302 --> 00:01:37.180
the bachelor's degrees in Yale
College,

00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:39.516
as designated by the Dean

00:01:39.516 --> 00:01:43.686
and admit you to all their
rights and responsibilities.

00:01:43.686 --> 00:01:45.772 align:start size:3% position:97% line:7%
♪

00:01:45.772 --> 00:01:48.733
[cheers and applause]

00:01:56.074 --> 00:01:58.701
I have the honor to present
candidates for degrees

00:01:58.701 --> 00:02:00.578
in the David Geffen
School of Drama,

00:02:00.578 --> 00:02:02.163
in the School of Architecture,

00:02:02.163 --> 00:02:04.082
in the School of Nursing

00:02:04.082 --> 00:02:12.841
[cheering]

